12
00:01:10.854 --> 00:01:15.270
Recovery time. Say it with me. Recovery time!

13
00:01:18.753 --> 00:01:33.734
Overtraining without a rest day increases injury risk. A good hydration strategy and proper technique protect athletes during sports. Wearing the right sports equipment helps prevent a serious injury like a concussion, which needs recovery time.

